### Phase 8: Offline-First Architecture

#### [NEW] `src/storage/GameStateDB.ts`
- Stores all game state in SQLite
- Queues API calls when offline
- Auto-syncs when connectivity returns
- Conflict resolution: last-write-wins with timestamp

#### [NEW] `src/storage/SyncManager.ts`
- Network status listener
- Background sync with exponential backoff
- Delta sync (only changed data)
- Bandwidth-aware: compresses payloads on 2G

